2026-03-31 16:51:05 | DEBUG    | sop_parser           |   Step 3: Generate Pivot Table 2 (by Country & Document Status). Create a second pivot table from the enriched SalesTaxDocumentLineExport with Document Status as a filter, Country as rows, and sum of USD Sales Amount and USD Tax Amount as value fields. Filter to show only Committed transactions. Name this tab 'PIVOT (Summary)'. In Column H, paste the equivalent pivot table from the previous month's VAT Avalara Sales Tax Report. Additionally, create a separate pivot with EU Country filter (excluding blanks) and paste the prior month's corresponding EU pivot in Column H.
