2026-03-31 16:51:05 | DEBUG    | sop_parser           |   Step 7: Audit Trail and Final Validation. Document complete audit trail including: (1) source totals from raw Avalara export, (2) count of transactions by status and country, (3) total USD conversions applied, (4) count and detail of exempt transactions removed, (5) count and detail of US transactions flagged, (6) count of missing/failed FX lookups, (7) final USD Tax Amount by GL code, (8) reconciliation variance between pivot and raw detail. Ensure all exception flags are documented with reason codes. Produce a final control report confirming data integrity and readiness for GL posting.
